      "- **Druggable Targets**: ", results$summary$chembl$druggable_targets %||% 0, " genes with known drug interactions\n",
      "- **Total Drug Interactions**: ", results$summary$chembl$total_interactions %||% 0, " unique drug-target pairs\n",
      "- **Unique Compounds**: ", results$summary$chembl$unique_drugs %||% 0, " distinct chemical entities\n\n",
      
