      "### Strategic Recommendations\n\n",
      "Based on the integrated analysis, we recommend prioritizing targets with cross-database validation for further investigation. ",
      "Targets showing both strong drug interaction profiles in ChEMBL and clinical validation in OpenTargets represent the highest-confidence opportunities.\n\n",
      
      "## Methodology\n\n",
      "This analysis integrated data from:\n",
      "- **ChEMBL Database**: For drug-target interaction data and bioactivity measurements\n",
      "- **OpenTargets Platform**: For clinical validation, druggability assessment, and safety profiles\n\n",
      
      "Analysis conducted using enhanced bioinformatics pipeline with cross-database validation.\n\n",
      
      "---\n",
      "*Report generated on ", Sys.Date(), "*"
    )
  }
  
